messages[14]{user,text}:
  user_2,Hello Kiara, this is Vikram Singh from ProtectAll Agency, how are you today? [00:00]
  user_1,Hi Vikram, I'm good, thanks. Uh, just a quick call—
  user_2,Great, I just wanted to confirm we got the laptop receipt you emailed earlier.
  user_1,Yes, I sent it right after our chat. Did you manage to attach it to the policy?
  user_2,Yep, I added your laptop under the personal‑property coverage, $5,000 limit for electronics. It’s now reflected in the system.
  user_1,Awesome, so my total personal‑property limit is still $150,000, right?
  user_2,Exactly, $150k total, with $5k earmarked for electronics like your laptop.
  user_1,Cool. Oh—actually, I was wondering if the policy also covers my new smartwatch?
  user_2,The standard electronics endorsement covers up to $2,000 for wearables, as long as you provide a receipt. Do you have it handy?
  user_1,Umm, I can email it later. Is that okay?
  user_2,Sure thing, just send it over and I'll add it. No extra premium for that small addition.
  user_2,Anything else you need help with today?
  user_1,No, that's all. Thanks for the help!
  user_2,You're welcome! Your home policy is now active with the updated coverage. Have a great day!